#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:3
msgid ""
"This page explains how a running gateway finds its configuration: which "
"files it reads, where those files live, and which layer wins when more "
"than one names the same file. It is the conceptual companion to [Adding a"
" New Model](adding-models.md) (the field-by-field model registry "
"reference) and [Routing](routing.md) (what the routing engine does with "
"the result)."
msgstr ""
"本页说明运行中的网关怎样找到自己的配置：读哪些文件，这些文件放在哪里，以及多个层级都给出了同一个配置文件的路径时，以哪一层为准。本页讲概念；模型注册表的逐字段参考见[添加新模型"
"](adding-models.md)，路由引擎怎样使用这些配置见[路由](routing.md)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:9
msgid ""
"For distribution manifests, branding, UI modules and backend extensions, "
"see [Distribution customization](distribution-customization.md)."
msgstr "发行版 manifest、品牌、UI 模块和后端扩展见[发行版定制](distribution-customization.md)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:12
msgid "Email and SMS delivery providers"
msgstr "邮件与短信发送服务"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:14
msgid ""
"`EMAIL_PROVIDER` defaults to `smtp`; `SMS_PROVIDER` defaults to `none`. "
"Every other provider is an optional module that a deployment loads "
"explicitly. A gateway that does not load a provider neither offers it nor"
" lists its settings in **Admin > Configuration**. Without a provider "
"beyond the built-in one, it does not list `EMAIL_PROVIDER` or "
"`SMS_PROVIDER` either, which would have only one value to choose, and "
"without an SMS provider it lists none of the phone settings. Selecting an"
" unavailable provider is a configuration error; delivery never silently "
"falls back to another provider."
msgstr ""
"`EMAIL_PROVIDER` 默认为 `smtp`，`SMS_PROVIDER` 默认为 "
"`none`。其他发送服务都是部署显式加载的可选模块。未加载某个服务的网关既不提供该选项，也不会在 **Admin > "
"Configuration** 中列出其配置。除内置服务外没有其他服务时，网关也不会列出 `EMAIL_PROVIDER` 或 "
"`SMS_PROVIDER`，因为它们只有一个值可选；没有短信服务时，网关不会列出任何手机号相关设置。选择不可用的服务属于配置错误；发送永远不会静默回退到其他服务。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:16
msgid ""
"SMTP mail travels over TLS that checks the server's certificate before "
"the password is sent. Port 465 uses TLS from the first byte; any other "
"`SMTP_PORT` must offer STARTTLS. The certificate must be valid for "
"`SMTP_HOST` and issued by an authority the backend trusts. A server with "
"a self-signed or privately issued certificate is refused, and the backend"
" log names the server and says why. Give it a certificate from a public "
"authority, or set `SSL_CERT_FILE` in the backend's environment to a "
"bundle that holds the system's authorities and the one that signed it."
msgstr ""
"SMTP 邮件经由 TLS 发送，并且在发送密码之前先校验服务器的证书。465 端口从第一个字节起就使用 TLS；其他任何 "
"`SMTP_PORT` 都必须支持 STARTTLS。证书必须对 `SMTP_HOST` "
"有效，并由后端信任的证书颁发机构签发。使用自签名证书或私有机构签发证书的服务器会被拒绝，后端日志会写明是哪台服务器以及原因。请为它换用公共证书颁发机构签发的证书，或者在后端的环境中设置"
" `SSL_CERT_FILE`，让它指向一个同时包含系统信任的颁发机构和签发该证书的机构的证书包。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:18
msgid ""
"Each distribution can add the providers its own inference hub needs, such"
" as a regional email or SMS service. A trusted module selected through "
"`BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` registers its email or SMS transport and "
"configuration entries before database-backed settings load. The shared "
"interfaces are `register_email_provider` and `register_sms_provider` in "
"`serving.utils.delivery`, and `register_config_entries` in "
"`serving.config.app_config_registry`. Extension settings keep the normal "
"database → environment → registered default precedence, validation, "
"secret masking and worker refresh. The extension reads them through "
"`config_value()` instead of adding vendor fields to shared `Settings`."
msgstr ""
"每个发行版都可以为自己的推理平台接入所需的发送服务，例如区域性的邮件或短信服务。通过 `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` "
"选择的可信模块，会在加载数据库配置前注册邮件或短信发送实现和配置项。共享接口包括 `serving.utils.delivery` 中的 "
"`register_email_provider`、`register_sms_provider`，以及 "
"`serving.config.app_config_registry` 中的 "
"`register_config_entries`。扩展配置保留数据库 → 环境变量 → 注册默认值的优先级、校验、秘密遮蔽和进程间刷新。扩展通过"
" `config_value()` 读取配置，不向共享 `Settings` 添加厂商字段。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:18
msgid "Tencent Cloud SES and SMS"
msgstr "腾讯云 SES 与短信"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:20
msgid ""
"The gateway ships one such module, `serving.integrations.tencent_cloud`, "
"for Tencent Cloud transactional email and SMS. It is not loaded by "
"default. Add it to `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` to offer "
"`EMAIL_PROVIDER=tencent_ses` and `SMS_PROVIDER=tencent`. A failed SES "
"request or missing SES template does not fall back to SMTP."
msgstr ""
"网关自带一个这样的模块 `serving.integrations.tencent_cloud`，用于腾讯云事务邮件和短信，默认不加载。将它加入 "
"`BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` 后，即可选择 `EMAIL_PROVIDER=tencent_ses` 和 "
"`SMS_PROVIDER=tencent`。SES 请求失败或缺少 SES 模板时不会回退到 SMTP。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:22
msgid ""
"Configure `TENCENT_CLOUD_SECRET_ID`, `TENCENT_CLOUD_SECRET_KEY`, optional"
" `TENCENT_CLOUD_TOKEN`, `TENCENT_SES_REGION`, `TENCENT_SES_FROM_EMAIL` "
"and optional `TENCENT_SES_FROM_NAME`. The sender must be approved in the "
"selected region. Secret values remain server-side and are redacted in the"
" configuration API. Keep production credentials and sender identities in "
"deployment configuration."
msgstr ""
"配置 `TENCENT_CLOUD_SECRET_ID`、`TENCENT_CLOUD_SECRET_KEY`、可选的 "
"`TENCENT_CLOUD_TOKEN`、`TENCENT_SES_REGION`、`TENCENT_SES_FROM_EMAIL` 和可选的 "
"`TENCENT_SES_FROM_NAME`。发件地址必须在所选地域审核通过。秘密值保留在服务端，配置 API "
"会隐藏这些值。生产凭据和发件身份应保存在部署配置中。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:24
msgid ""
"Set positive IDs for `TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_VERIFICATION` and "
"`TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_PASSWORD_RESET` before enabling SES account mail. "
"Configure `TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_APPROVAL`, "
"`TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_REJECTION`, `TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_ADMIN_SIGNUP` and"
" `TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_NOTICE` for the notifications the deployment uses."
" Unset IDs disable those templates. Configuration health reports missing "
"SES account-mail fields when public signup requires email verification, "
"instead of asking for SMTP credentials."
msgstr ""
"启用 SES 账号邮件前，为 `TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_VERIFICATION` 和 "
"`TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_PASSWORD_RESET` 设置正整数 ID。根据部署使用的通知配置 "
"`TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_APPROVAL`、`TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_REJECTION`、`TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_ADMIN_SIGNUP`"
" 和 `TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_NOTICE`。未设置的 ID "
"会禁用对应模板。当开放注册要求验证邮箱时，配置健康检查会报告缺失的 SES 账号邮件字段，不再要求 SMTP 凭据。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:26
msgid ""
"Reference HTML lives in `apps/backend/serving/integrations/tencent_cloud"
"/ses-templates/`. Before submitting templates for provider approval, "
"replace the example domain with the deployment console domain and choose "
"the desired language and wording. Verification and reset templates "
"contain a fixed HTTPS origin and path; only the encoded `token` query "
"value varies. Other templates use `site_name` and, where applicable, "
"`reason`, `identifier` or `body`. Keep template links consistent with "
"`FRONTEND_URL`; the gateway cannot inspect approved template contents."
msgstr ""
"参考 HTML 位于 `apps/backend/serving/integrations/tencent_cloud/ses-"
"templates/`。提交供应商审核前，将示例域名替换为部署控制台域名，并选择所需语言和文案。验证与重置模板包含固定的 HTTPS "
"来源和路径，只有编码后的 `token` 查询值会变化。其他模板使用 `site_name`，并按需使用 "
"`reason`、`identifier` 或 `body`。模板链接应与 `FRONTEND_URL` 保持一致；网关无法检查已审核模板的内容。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:28
msgid ""
"SES receives approved templates with escaped scalar values, never "
"arbitrary HTML variables. Serialized template data is limited to 800 "
"UTF-8 bytes; oversized notices and HTML-only notices fail rather than "
"being truncated. Successful submission means provider acceptance, not "
"inbox delivery. Calls are not automatically retried because a timeout can"
" follow acceptance. Deployments that require unrestricted HTML mail or "
"long notices can continue to use SMTP."
msgstr ""
"SES 接收审核模板和经过转义的标量变量，不接收任意 HTML 变量。序列化后的模板数据限制为 800 个 UTF-8 字节；超长通知及仅有 "
"HTML "
"的通知会失败，不会被截断。提交成功表示供应商已接受请求，不代表邮件已送达收件箱。请求不会自动重试，因为超时可能发生在请求已被接受之后。需要任意 "
"HTML 邮件或较长通知的部署可以继续使用 SMTP。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:30
msgid ""
"The SMS provider requires `TENCENT_CLOUD_SECRET_ID`, "
"`TENCENT_CLOUD_SECRET_KEY`, `SMS_REGION`, `SMS_SDK_APP_ID`, "
"`SMS_SIGN_NAME` and `SMS_TEMPLATE_ID`. Temporary credentials also require"
" `TENCENT_CLOUD_TOKEN`. Its approved template takes the code and its "
"lifetime in minutes, in that order. It currently sends to mainland China "
"mobile numbers only: set `SMS_DEFAULT_COUNTRY_CODE` to `86` if local "
"input is desired and `SMS_ALLOWED_PREFIXES` to `+86`. Keep real "
"credentials, approved signatures and template IDs in deployment "
"configuration, outside source control."
msgstr ""
"短信服务需要 "
"`TENCENT_CLOUD_SECRET_ID`、`TENCENT_CLOUD_SECRET_KEY`、`SMS_REGION`、`SMS_SDK_APP_ID`、`SMS_SIGN_NAME`"
" 和 `SMS_TEMPLATE_ID`。临时凭据还需要 "
"`TENCENT_CLOUD_TOKEN`。审核通过的模板依次接收验证码和有效分钟数两个参数。它目前仅向中国大陆手机号发送短信：如需支持本地输入，将"
" `SMS_DEFAULT_COUNTRY_CODE` 设为 `86`，并将 `SMS_ALLOWED_PREFIXES` 设为 "
"`+86`。真实凭据、已审核签名和模板 ID 应保存在部署配置中，不要提交到源码仓库。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:32
msgid ""
"A deployment that used the Tencent adapter before it became optional adds"
" the module to `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` when it upgrades; setting names and "
"stored values are unchanged. On a gateway that does not load a provider, "
"a stored row it once used lists as an ordinary custom setting that no "
"code reads, keeping its secret flag, and an administrator can delete it."
msgstr ""
"此前使用腾讯适配器的部署在升级时把该模块加入 "
"`BACKEND_EXTENSIONS`，配置名称和存储值都不变。未加载某个服务的网关会把它曾使用的残留旧行列为普通自定义配置：没有代码读取它，秘密标记保留，管理员可以删除。"

