#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid ""
"Credentials, SMTP, proxy trust, logging, routing tuning and every other "
"application setting, stored in the database and edited in the admin "
"console"
msgstr "凭据、SMTP、代理信任、日志、路由调优以及其他所有应用设置项，存放在数据库里，在管理控制台中编辑"

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "环境变量"

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid ""
"The database connection, the paths to the files above, and how the "
"containers are wired"
msgstr "数据库连接、上面这些文件的路径，以及容器之间怎样连接"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:44
msgid ""
"Only the model registry is required to serve traffic. Without it the "
"gateway starts, serves `/health`, and answers `GET /v1/models` with an "
"empty list. Without a routing file each route keeps the weight the "
"registry gives it, and without an alerts file the built-in thresholds "
"apply."
msgstr ""
"要承接流量，必需的只有模型注册表。没有它，网关照样能启动、提供 `/health`，只是 `GET /v1/models` "
"会返回空列表。没有路由配置文件，每条路由保持注册表给它的权重；没有告警配置文件，则使用内置阈值。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:49
msgid ""
"The built-in `rules.request_log_queue_saturation` rule pages when the "
"bounded request-log queue drops `api_logs` report rows. It is on by "
"default but still only runs when alerting is otherwise enabled "
"(`ALERTS_ENABLED` and a configured channel). Tune or disable it in "
"`alerts.yaml`:"
msgstr ""
"内置的 `rules.request_log_queue_saturation` 规则会在有界请求日志队列丢弃 `api_logs` "
"报表行时触发告警。该规则默认开启，但仍须启用告警系统（`ALERTS_ENABLED`）并配置通知渠道才会运行。可在 `alerts.yaml` "
"中调整或关闭："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:63
msgid ""
"`threshold_count` counts the producer's loss warnings, not dropped rows. "
"The producer warns on the first drop, every 100th drop, and at least once"
" per 60 seconds while drops continue, so a second small burst after a "
"quiet period is still observable. The rule uses the alert engine's "
"existing cooldown, so a sustained loss episode does not page once per "
"warning."
msgstr ""
"`threshold_count` 统计生产端发出的丢弃警告次数，而不是丢弃行数。生产端在首次丢弃、每累计丢弃 100 "
"行时发出警告；持续丢弃期间还会按 60 "
"秒间隔刷新警告，因此静默一段时间后再次出现的小批量丢弃仍可被观测。该规则复用告警引擎现有的冷却机制，不会在持续丢弃期间每收到一次警告就发送一次通知。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:69
msgid ""
"Every record-driven rule keeps at most 250,000 samples in its window. At "
"traffic that would exceed that, the oldest samples leave early: the "
"window then covers less than `window_sec`, and a rate alert says `only "
"the latest 250000 samples are kept`. The `top_paths` line of "
"`failed_request_rate` tracks at most 256 distinct paths per window. "
"Failures on any other path still count toward the rate, and the line says"
" how many it left out."
msgstr ""
"每条由日志记录驱动的规则，其窗口内最多保留 250,000 个样本。流量高到会超出这一数量时，最早的样本会提前移出：此时窗口覆盖的时长短于 "
"`window_sec`，比率类告警会注明 `only the latest 250000 samples are "
"kept`。`failed_request_rate` 告警中的 `top_paths` 一行在每个窗口内最多跟踪 256 "
"个不同路径。其他路径上的失败仍计入失败率，该行会注明有多少未列出。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:77
msgid ""
"The files are not the whole story once a database is configured. The "
"admin console writes providers, keys, routes, weights and per-model "
"overrides to the operational store, and the gateway re-applies that state"
" on top of the loaded registry at every start. [Runtime configuration "
"from the admin console](#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-console) "
"covers that layer, and [Settings stored in the database](#settings-"
"stored-in-the-database) covers the settings."
msgstr ""
"有了数据库之后，配置就不只来自文件了。管理控制台会把 "
"provider、key、路由、权重和按模型的覆盖项写进运行数据存储，网关每次启动时都会在加载好的注册表之上重新应用这些状态。这一层见[从管理控制台做运行时配置"
"](#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-console)，设置项见[存储在数据库中的设置项"
"](#settings-stored-in-the-database)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:86
msgid "Where configuration lives"
msgstr "配置放在哪里"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:88
msgid ""
"`config/examples/` contains reference gateway configuration, including "
"`models.openrouter.yaml` and `routing.minimal.yaml`. A deployment keeps "
"its model registry, routing rules and alerts in its own configuration "
"directory, such as `distributions/<name>/config/`, and selects them "
"through explicit environment variables or an active distribution "
"manifest. [Distribution customization](distribution-customization.md#the-"
"distribution-manifest) explains the manifest and overlay layout."
msgstr ""
"`config/examples/` 里是网关的参考配置，包括 `models.openrouter.yaml` 和 "
"`routing.minimal.yaml`。每个部署把自己的模型注册表、路由规则和告警放在自己的配置目录里，例如 "
"`distributions/<name>/config/`，再通过显式的环境变量或已启用的发行版 manifest "
"选用这些文件。manifest 和 overlay 的目录结构见[发行版定制](distribution-customization.md"
"#the-distribution-manifest)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:96
msgid ""
"A provider, key, route or whole model can also be added from the admin "
"console while the gateway runs. That state lives in Postgres and is "
"described [below](#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-console)."
msgstr ""
"网关运行期间，也可以在管理控制台里添加 provider、key、路由乃至整个模型。这些状态保存在 Postgres 里，详见[下文"
"](#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-console)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:100
msgid "How a gateway finds its config"
msgstr "网关如何找到自己的配置"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:102
msgid "Precedence is environment, then manifest, then built-in default."
msgstr "优先级依次是：环境变量、manifest、内置默认值。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:104
msgid "Each kind of file is looked up on its own, in this order:"
msgstr "每类文件都单独查找，顺序如下："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:106
msgid ""
"**An explicit environment variable.** `MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`, "
"`ROUTING_CONFIG_PATH`, `ALERTS_CONFIG_PATH`. (The older names "
"`MODELS_CONFIG` and `ROUTING_CONFIG` are still accepted; the canonical "
"`*_CONFIG_PATH` name wins when both are set.)"
msgstr ""
"**显式设置的环境变量**。`MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`、`ROUTING_CONFIG_PATH`、`ALERTS_CONFIG_PATH`。（旧名"
" `MODELS_CONFIG` 和 `ROUTING_CONFIG` 仍然可用；两者都设置时，以规范名 `*_CONFIG_PATH` 为准。）"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:110
msgid ""
"**The distribution manifest's `paths:` section** — only when "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active`. By default a manifest is only checked,"
" not applied; see [Activating a manifest](distribution-"
"customization.md#activating-a-manifest)."
msgstr ""
"**发行版 manifest 的 `paths:` 部分**——仅在 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active` "
"时生效。默认情况下只检查 manifest，不应用它；见[启用 manifest](distribution-"
"customization.md#activating-a-manifest)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:114
msgid ""
"**The built-in default**, which points at the reference examples: "
"`config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml` and "
"`config/examples/routing.minimal.yaml`. The `alerts` default is "
"`config/alerts.yaml`, a path this repository does not ship — a missing "
"alerts file means \"use the built-in thresholds\"."
msgstr ""
"**内置默认值**，指向参考示例：`config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml` 和 "
"`config/examples/routing.minimal.yaml`。`alerts` 的默认值是 "
"`config/alerts.yaml`，本仓库并不带这个文件——缺少告警配置文件就表示「使用内置阈值」。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:120
msgid "Two things follow:"
msgstr "这意味着两件事："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:122
msgid ""
"An environment variable **beats the manifest**. If you set "
"`MODELS_CONFIG_PATH` in a deployment that also has a manifest, the "
"manifest's `models:` path is ignored, and the gateway logs `explicit env "
"override ... wins over manifest value ...`. Pick one mechanism."
msgstr ""
"环境变量**优先于 manifest**。如果部署已经有 manifest，你又设置了 `MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`，manifest"
" 里的 `models:` 路径就会被忽略，网关会记一条 `explicit env override ... wins over "
"manifest value ...` 日志。两种方式选一种就好。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:126
msgid ""
"Paths that come from the environment are resolved relative to the "
"**working directory** of the process. Relative paths inside a manifest "
"are resolved against **the manifest file's own directory**."
msgstr "来自环境变量的路径，相对于进程的**工作目录**解析；manifest 里的相对路径，则相对于 **manifest 文件自己所在的目录**解析。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:130
msgid ""
"A path that resolves from layer 1 or 2 but does not exist is a warning, "
"not a failure: the gateway logs `Models config not found: <path> "
"(source=env)` and continues with no models registered. That warning is "
"about the file lookup. Once the database holds a models or routing row, "
"the file is no longer read."
msgstr ""
"如果第 1 层或第 2 层给出的路径实际不存在，网关只会发出警告，不会启动失败：它记录 `Models config not found: "
"<path> (source=env)`，然后在一个模型都没注册的状态下继续运行。这条警告只针对文件查找。一旦数据库里存有 models 或 "
"routing 的行，就不再读取这个文件。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:135
msgid "Model and routing documents in the database"
msgstr "数据库中的模型和路由文档"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:137
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"On a database-backed boot the gateway copies `models.yaml` and "
"`routing.yaml` into `route_catalog` when that kind has no row and the "
"file exists and is not blank. The copy keeps `${VAR}` unresolved. Later "
"boots register from the row, and settings discovery scans the row. Alerts"
" stay a file."
msgstr ""
"使用数据库启动时，如果某个 kind 在 `route_catalog` 里还没有行，且文件存在且非空，网关会把 `models.yaml` 和 "
"`routing.yaml` 复制进去。复制时保留未展开的 `${VAR}`。之后的启动从这一行注册，设置项发现也扫描这一行。告警配置仍是文件。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:142
msgid ""
"A stored row wins, including an empty one. Editing the file and "
"restarting does not change it. Delete the row and restart to import the "
"file again. `provider_route_configs`, runtime candidates and weight "
"overrides still apply on top of whichever document was loaded."
msgstr ""
"已存的行优先，空行也算。改文件再重启不会改变它。删掉这一行再重启，才会重新导入文件。`provider_route_configs`、运行时添加的候选路由和权重覆盖项，仍然叠在实际加载的那份文档之上。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:147
msgid "What a fresh clone does with no configuration at all"
msgstr "全新克隆、完全没有配置时会怎样"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:149
msgid ""
"Start the gateway in a clean checkout with no `MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`, no "
"manifest and no overlay, and the built-in default applies: it serves "
"`config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml`. That file registers three "
"models — two straight OpenRouter routes and one that puts a local OpenAI-"
"compatible server first with OpenRouter as automatic fallback — and every"
" one of them needs the same single credential."
msgstr ""
"在一个干净的仓库里启动网关，不设 `MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`，也没有 manifest 和 "
"overlay，这时用的是内置默认值：网关加载 "
"`config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml`。这个文件注册了三个模型：两个直接走 "
"OpenRouter，另一个优先用本地的 OpenAI 兼容服务器，失败时自动回退到 OpenRouter。三个模型都只需要同一个凭据。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:161
msgid ""
"Without that variable every model in the file is skipped — its route's "
"only API key expands to empty — and the gateway says so before serving "
"anything:"
msgstr "不设这个变量，文件里的每个模型都会被跳过（每条路由唯一的 API key 展开后是空的），网关在开始服务之前就会给出提示："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:171
msgid ""
"With a database, set it on the admin console's **Configuration** tab "
"instead, which lists it as missing, and restart the backend."
msgstr "有数据库时，改为在管理控制台的 **Configuration** 标签页上设置它（那里会把它标为缺失），然后重启后端。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:174
msgid ""
"This is the fastest way to a gateway that routes real traffic. Replace "
"the file with your own registry once you know what you want to serve."
msgstr "这是让网关跑上真实流量的最快路径。等你想清楚要提供哪些模型，再用自己的注册表替换这个文件。"

