"kind: <kind>`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:206
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`${VAR}` interpolation in the registry is whole-value only.** In "
"`models.yaml`, only `base_url`, `api_key`, `api_keys`, "
"`provider_model_id` and a route's `embeddings_path` are expanded, and "
"only when the entire value is exactly `${VAR}`. The value is the [setting"
"](#settings-stored-in-the-database) of that name: its database value, "
"else the environment variable, else the default the gateway registers for"
" that setting, so `${CHUTES_BASE_URL}` loads as "
"`https://llm.chutes.ai/v1` when nothing sets it. A database or "
"environment value wins even when it is empty. There is no "
"`${VAR:-default}` and no embedded substitution:"
msgstr ""
"**注册表里的 `${VAR}` 插值只支持整值替换**。在 `models.yaml` 里，只有 "
"`base_url`、`api_key`、`api_keys`、`provider_model_id` 和路由的 "
"`embeddings_path` 会被展开，而且只在整个值恰好是 `${VAR}` 时才展开。取到的值是同名的[设置项](#settings-"
"stored-in-the-"
"database)：先看数据库里的值，没有再用环境变量，再没有就用网关为这个设置项注册的默认值，所以什么都没设置时，`${CHUTES_BASE_URL}`"
" 会以 `https://llm.chutes.ai/v1` 加载。数据库或环境变量里的值哪怕为空也优先。不支持 "
"`${VAR:-default}`，也不支持嵌在字符串中间的替换："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:225
msgid ""
"The routing and alerts files are more permissive (see below), so do not "
"carry habits from one file to the other."
msgstr "路由配置文件和告警配置文件的展开规则更宽松（见下文），所以别把一种文件里的写法习惯带到另一种文件里。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:228
