" that vendor and is declared with the `PROVIDER_ROUTE_TYPES` setting (see"
" [Environment variables](installation.md#environment-variables)); an "
"unlisted provider may use any of the three."
msgstr ""
"这个标签页上的 provider 选择器会列出所有自定义 provider，以及注册表、当前路由表或已配置凭据中已经出现的内置 "
"kind。provider 能以哪种路由类型添加（`on_demand`、`quota` 或 "
"`concurrency`），取决于部署和这家供应商的约定，用 `PROVIDER_ROUTE_TYPES` "
"这个设置项声明（见[环境变量](installation.md#environment-variables)）；没有列出的 provider "
"三种都可以用。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:398
msgid ""
"A model created here is a **runtime model**: it exists only in the "
"database, carries an id, a first route, a pricing table, a router "
"strategy and a `required_role` (default `admin`, so a new model stays "
"invisible to ordinary users until you lower it), and is restored at every"
" start. It also declares what it accepts, as `capabilities` in the "
"request: `context_length`, `max_output_length`, `input_modalities` "
"(`text`, optionally `image`, `audio` and `video`) and `supports_tools`. "
"All four are required, because each changes what a request does: a model "
"without tool support has tool definitions dropped, `max_tokens` is "
"clamped to `max_output_length`, an image reaches only a route that "
"accepts images, and Auto and the context-overflow fallback read "
"`context_length`. The two lengths are whole numbers of tokens, at most "
"10,000,000. A route added to any model, runtime or registry, declares its"
" own four the same way; the console starts them from the model's first "
"route, and the route stores what was submitted. Each route stores and "
"restores its own four, since routes of one model can differ. A runtime "
"model created before they could be declared keeps the defaults it was "
"given: `context_length` 8192, `max_output_length` 4096, text only, no "
"tool support. Supported parameters such as `reasoning_effort`, structured"
" output and aliases still take `ModelConfig`'s defaults; when a model "
"needs any of those, put it in the registry."
msgstr ""
"在这里创建的模型是**运行时模型**：它只存在于数据库里，包含 id、第一条路由、定价表、router 策略和 "
"`required_role`（默认 `admin`，所以在你调低之前，普通用户看不到这个新模型），每次启动时都会恢复。它还要在请求的 "
"`capabilities` "
"里声明自己接受什么：`context_length`、`max_output_length`、`input_modalities`（`text`，可再加"
" `image`、`audio` 和 `video`）和 "
"`supports_tools`。四项都必填，因为每一项都会改变请求的实际行为：不支持工具的模型会丢掉工具定义，`max_tokens` 会被截到"
" `max_output_length`，图片只会送到接受图片的路由，Auto 和上下文超限后的备用路由都会读 "
"`context_length`。两个长度都是 token 数，必须是整数，最大 "
"10,000,000。给任何模型（运行时模型或注册表里的模型）加路由时，新路由也要用同样的方式声明自己的这四项；控制台会先填上这个模型第一条路由的值，路由保存的是最终提交的值。每条路由各自保存、各自恢复这四项，因为同一个模型的不同路由可能不一样。在能声明这四项之前创建的运行时模型，保留当时拿到的默认值：`context_length`"
" 8192，`max_output_length` 4096，只支持文本，不支持工具调用。支持的参数（例如 "
"`reasoning_effort`）、结构化输出和别名仍取 `ModelConfig` 的默认值；模型需要其中任何一项时，就把它写进注册表。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:418
msgid ""
"Any route's four can be changed after the fact in its **Edit** form, "
"registry and runtime routes alike, with the same validation. They change "
"what the gateway does with requests through the route, not what the "
"upstream model can do. The console's form has a field for image input "
"only: it keeps a route's `audio` and `video` input as they are, and an "
"added route starts with the first route's. The values the route has from "
"the registry or from its creation stay as its baseline: the change is "
"stored as an override, the next request through the route follows it, a "
"restart restores it, and retargeting the route keeps it. Deleting a "
"registry route keeps it too, so **Restore** brings the route back with "
"it. **Restore defaults** fills the form with the baseline; saving it, or "
"any values equal to the baseline, deletes the override, so the route goes"
" on following its registry or creation values. An edit that also changes "
"the route's target is saved in one request: `PUT .../provider-routes/...`"
" and `PATCH .../provider-route-candidates/...` accept `capabilities`, or "
"`reset_capabilities: true`, and when either part cannot be saved the "
"gateway puts both back. That is a restore of the earlier rows and live "
"route, not one database transaction; a restore that fails is logged. "
"Route listings report `capabilities` (as served), `capabilities_baseline`"
" and `capabilities_overridden`. A change applies in the gateway process "
"that handles the admin request; a deployment running several gateway "
"processes sees it in the others after their next restart."
msgstr ""
"任何路由的这四项之后都可以在它的 **Edit** "
"表单里修改，注册表路由和运行时路由都可以，校验规则相同。它们改变的是网关如何处理经过这条路由的请求，而不是上游模型本身能做什么。控制台表单只有图片输入这一项：路由已有的"
" `audio` 和 `video` "
"输入会原样保留，新加的路由则沿用第一条路由的。路由在注册表里或创建时的值保留为它的基线：修改作为覆盖项保存，经过这条路由的下一个请求就按新值处理，重启后会恢复，改路由的目标也不会丢掉它。删除注册表路由同样会保留它，用"
" **Restore** 恢复路由时会一并带回。**Restore defaults** "
"把基线值填进表单；保存它，或保存任何与基线相同的值，都会删除覆盖项，让路由继续沿用注册表或创建时的值。同时修改路由目标的编辑在一个请求里保存：`PUT"
" .../provider-routes/...` 和 `PATCH .../provider-route-candidates/...` 接受 "
"`capabilities` 或 `reset_capabilities: "
"true`，任何一部分保存失败时，网关会把两者都恢复。这是恢复之前的数据行和在用路由，不是单个数据库事务；恢复失败会记入日志。路由列表会返回 "
"`capabilities`（当前生效的值）、`capabilities_baseline` 和 "
"`capabilities_overridden`。修改在处理这次管理请求的网关进程里生效；运行多个网关进程的部署，其他进程要在下次重启后才会看到。"

