msgid "`model_visibility_overrides`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid "Exempt a model from the per-user concurrency limit"
msgstr "让某个模型不受每用户并发上限的限制"

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid "**Model Concurrency Limit**"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`PATCH /admin/models/{model_id}/concurrency`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid "`model_concurrency_exemptions`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid "Cap how many batch requests a model runs at once"
msgstr "限制一个模型同时运行的批量请求数"

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid "**Batch Concurrency**"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`PATCH /admin/batch/models/{model_id}` sets or clears a model's cap; `GET"
" /admin/batch/models` lists the caps with each model's running and queued"
" batch requests. The other batch settings are in [Running batch "
"inference](batches.md#running-batch-inference)"
msgstr ""
"`PATCH /admin/batch/models/{model_id}` 设置或清除某个模型的上限；`GET "
"/admin/batch/models` 列出各模型的上限及其正在运行和排队的批量请求。其他批量设置项见[运行批量推理](batches.md"
"#running-batch-inference)"

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid "`batch_model_limits`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:448
msgid "How the two layers combine"
msgstr "两层如何叠加"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:450
msgid ""
"The registry is loaded first and the stored state is applied on top of "
"it, in this order at boot; each admin change is also applied to the "
"running router the moment it is saved."
msgstr "启动时先加载注册表，再按下面的顺序把已存状态叠加上去；管理员的每次改动在保存时也会立即应用到运行中的 router 上。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:454
msgid "Custom provider definitions, skipping any slug the code or registry owns."
msgstr "自定义 provider 定义；代码或注册表里已有的 slug 会被跳过。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:455
msgid ""
"Stored provider keys, seeded into each provider's pool beside the "
"environment keys."
msgstr "已存的 provider key，加入各个 provider 的 key 池，与环境变量里的 key 并列。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:457
msgid "Per-model router strategy overrides."
msgstr "按模型设置的 router 策略覆盖项。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:458
msgid ""
"Runtime routes. A runtime model is restored only if its creation "
"finished; a stored route whose model is no longer in the registry is "
"skipped with a warning, so removing a model from YAML does not bring it "
"back through a leftover row."
msgstr ""
"运行时路由。运行时模型只有在创建过程完整结束后才会被恢复；如果一条已存路由对应的模型已经不在注册表里，它会被跳过并记录警告，所以从 YAML "
"里删掉一个模型，不会因为一行残留数据又把它带回来。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:462
msgid "Route overrides, retargeting the registry routes they name."
msgstr "路由覆盖项，把对应的注册表路由改指到新的目标。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:463
msgid ""
"Route capability overrides, last of the route state, so they reach every "
"route the steps above installed."
msgstr "路由能力覆盖项，在路由状态里最后应用，这样上面各步装好的每条路由都能覆盖到。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:465
msgid ""
"Key tier reservations, re-read now that every provider is known; then "
"weight overrides, disabled providers, offload routes and model "
"visibility, loaded into resolvers the router consults at request time."
msgstr ""
"key 的层级预留：此时所有 provider 都已加载，所以再读一遍。然后是权重覆盖项、已禁用的 "
"provider、卸载路由和模型可见性，这些会加载到解析器里，供 router 在处理请求时查询。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:469
msgid ""
"Two rules follow from that order. A stored change never edits the file it"
" overrides: delete the override and the registry route, weight or "
"`router:` value is back, and a runtime candidate sits beside the "
"registry's routes rather than replacing them. Once a models or routing "
"row is stored, that document wins over a later edit to the file; delete "
"the row and restart to import again. See [Model and routing documents in "
"the database](#model-and-routing-documents-in-the-database)."
msgstr ""
"由这个顺序可以得出两条规则。第一，已存的改动从不修改它覆盖的文件：删掉覆盖项，注册表里的路由、权重或 `router:` "
"值就恢复了；运行时添加的候选路由和注册表的路由并存，而不是取代它们。第二，一旦存有 models 或 routing "
"的行，这份文档就优先于之后对文件的修改；删掉这一行再重启，才会重新导入。见[数据库中的模型和路由文档](#model-and-routing-"
"documents-in-the-database)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:476
msgid "Settings stored in the database"
msgstr "存储在数据库中的设置项"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:478
msgid ""
"Everything the gateway reads that is not one of the files above, the "
"database connection or container wiring is a *setting*: provider keys, "
"SMTP, Slack webhooks, proxy trust, browser origins, logging, routing and "
"timeout tuning, the cloud-agent contract, and the secrets that sign "
"sessions and protect API keys. A gateway with a database keeps them in "
"its `app_config` table, and an administrator edits them on the admin "
"console's **Settings** tab. A gateway with `DB_ENABLED=false` has no "
"stored settings and reads the environment and the built-in defaults only."
msgstr ""
"网关读取的东西里，凡不是上面这些文件、数据库连接或容器连接方式的，都是*设置项*：provider key、SMTP、Slack "
"webhook、代理信任、浏览器来源（origin）、日志、路由和超时调优、与云端 agent 的约定，以及签发会话、保护 API key "
"的密钥。有数据库的网关把它们存在 `app_config` 表里，由管理员在管理控制台的 **Settings** "
"标签页上编辑。`DB_ENABLED=false` 的网关没有存储的设置项，只读环境变量和内置默认值。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:487
msgid "Where a value comes from"
msgstr "值从哪里来"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:489
msgid "Each setting resolves in this order:"
msgstr "每个设置项按以下顺序取值："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:491
msgid ""
"its row in the database — even an empty one, which is how a setting is "
"cleared;"
msgstr "数据库里它的那一行——哪怕值为空也算，清空一个设置项靠的就是这个；"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:493
msgid "the environment variable of the same name;"
msgstr "同名的环境变量；"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:494
msgid "the built-in default."
msgstr "内置默认值。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:496
msgid ""
"The environment is a starting point. At every start, a setting that has a"
" non-empty value in the environment and no row in the database is copied "
"into the database, and from then on the row wins. That is how an existing"
" `.env` carries over on an upgrade, and why editing the variable "
"afterwards changes nothing: the tab marks it **Environment ignored**. "
"Change the value on the tab instead, or **Reset** it, so that the "
"environment, and then the default, applies again. A reset lasts: the "
"database remembers it, so the next start does not copy the variable in "
"again, and later edits to it take effect. The switches on the "
"**Settings** tab — `USER_AUTH_ENABLED`, `SIGNUP_ENABLED` and the others —"
" are copied from the environment the same way."
msgstr ""
"环境变量只是起点。每次启动时，凡是在环境变量里有非空值、而数据库里还没有对应行的设置项，都会被复制进数据库，此后以数据库里的行为准。升级时现有的 "
"`.env` 就是这样延续下来的；也正因为如此，之后再改这个环境变量不会有任何效果：标签页会把它标为 **Environment "
"ignored**。要改就在标签页上改值，或者用 **Reset** "
"重置它，让环境变量、再往后是默认值重新生效。重置是持久的：数据库会记住这次重置，下次启动时不会再把这个变量复制进来，之后对它的修改也会生效。**Settings**"
" 标签页上的开关（`USER_AUTH_ENABLED`、`SIGNUP_ENABLED` 等）也以同样的方式从环境变量复制过去。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:508
msgid ""
"An environment value that is not valid on its own — a CIDR range that "
"does not parse, a number that is not one — is not copied in. The backend "
"then starts only if the database holds a valid value for that setting, "
"which applies, with a warning in the log; otherwise it stops and names "
"the variable. Fix or remove the variable, or store a valid value with "
"`python -m serving.config.manage set` (see *Without the console* below), "
"which works while the environment is invalid. The database connection "
"settings (`DB_HOST`, `DB_PORT` and the others) are the exception: they "
"are needed to read the database, so an invalid one always stops the "
"backend."
msgstr ""
"环境变量里的值如果本身就不合法（比如无法解析的 CIDR "
"范围，或者该填数字的地方填的不是数字），就不会被复制进数据库。这时只有数据库里存有该设置项的合法值，后端才会启动，并使用这个值，同时在日志里给出警告；否则后端会停下来，并指出是哪个变量。修正或删除这个变量，或者用"
" `python -m serving.config.manage set` 存入一个合法值（见下文 *不通过控制台* "
"一节），环境变量无效时这个命令照样能用。数据库连接设置（`DB_HOST`、`DB_PORT` "
"等）是例外：读取数据库需要它们，所以其中任何一个无效，后端都会停下来。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:518
msgid ""
"Settings that depend on each other — `TRUST_X_REAL_IP` needs "
"`TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` — are judged together, and a stored value wins "
"there too. A variable whose partner is already stored and satisfies the "
"rule is copied in like any other, so it survives the variable's removal. "
"One that breaks the rule with a stored value is set aside instead: it "
"counts as unset, its default applies, the next start does not copy it in,"
" and the log says so with a warning. With `TRUST_X_REAL_IP=1` in the "
"environment and `TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` stored as off, for example, the "
"gateway runs with `TRUST_X_REAL_IP` off; to turn both on, change them "
"together on the Settings tab or with `python -m serving.config.manage "
"set`. Only a rule the environment breaks on its own, with no stored value"
" involved, stops the backend, which names the rule."
msgstr ""
"相互依赖的设置项（`TRUST_X_REAL_IP` 需要 "
"`TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS`）会放在一起判断，存储的值在这里同样优先。如果一个变量的搭档已经存储并且满足规则，它会像其他变量一样被复制进去，所以即使删掉这个环境变量，它也会保留。与存储值一起违反规则的变量则会被搁置：它被当作未设置，使用默认值，下次启动也不会复制进去，日志里会有一条警告说明这一点。比如环境变量里是"
" `TRUST_X_REAL_IP=1`，而存储的 `TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` 是关闭的，网关就会在 "
"`TRUST_X_REAL_IP` 关闭的状态下运行；要把两者都打开，就在 Settings 标签页上或用 `python -m "
"serving.config.manage set` 一起修改。只有环境变量自己（不涉及任何存储值）违反的规则才会让后端停下，并指出是哪条规则。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:531
msgid ""
"On the first start against an empty database the backend also generates "
"the two secrets it cannot run without, `JWT_SECRET_KEY` and "
"`API_KEY_SECRET`, unless the environment supplies them. `API_KEY_SECRET` "
"and `ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET` cannot be changed once set, because records "
"depend on them; see [Database](database.md#secrets-for-deleting-"
"accounts). The backend refuses to start rather than generate "
"`API_KEY_SECRET` for a database that already holds API keys, since a new "
"secret would invalidate every one of them."
msgstr ""
"第一次连着空数据库启动时，后端还会生成它运行所必需的两个密钥 `JWT_SECRET_KEY` 和 "
"`API_KEY_SECRET`，除非环境变量里已经提供。`API_KEY_SECRET` 和 `ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET` "
"一旦设置就不能再改，因为已有的记录依赖它们；见[数据库](database.md#secrets-for-deleting-"
"accounts)。如果数据库里已经有 API key，后端宁可拒绝启动，也不会为它生成新的 "
"`API_KEY_SECRET`，因为新密钥会让所有这些 key 失效。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:539
msgid "Analytics sections"
msgstr "Analytics 区块"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:541
msgid ""
"In **Admin → Settings → Common → Analytics**, toggle **Token Usage**, "
"**Users and Requests**, **Performance Metrics** and **Growth Rate** "
"independently, then select **Save changes**. These database-backed "
"settings apply to **Analytics → Overview** for all administrators. Token "
"Usage, Users and Requests and Performance Metrics default to on; Growth "
"Rate defaults to off. Reopen Analytics after saving; no backend restart "
"is needed. A disabled section is hidden and does not request its data. "
"Data collection continues, so re-enabling a section can show existing "
"history."
msgstr ""
"在 **Admin → Settings → Common → Analytics** 中，分别切换 **Token "
"Usage**、**Users and Requests**、**Performance Metrics** 和 **Growth "
"Rate**，然后点击 **Save changes**。这些设置保存在数据库中，对所有管理员的 **Analytics → Overview**"
" 生效。Token Usage、Users and Requests 和 Performance Metrics 默认开启，Growth Rate"
" 默认关闭。保存后重新打开 Analytics "
"即可，无需重启后端。关闭的区块会隐藏，且不请求其数据。数据仍持续收集，因此重新启用区块后可以查看已有历史。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:550
msgid ""
"The runtime keys are `analytics_token_usage_enabled`, "
"`analytics_users_and_requests_enabled`, "
"`analytics_performance_metrics_enabled` and "
"`analytics_growth_rate_enabled`. The overview's Hour / Day / Week / Month"
" control applies to Token Usage and Users and Requests. Performance "
"Metrics keeps its existing windows, and Growth Rate has its own 30, 60 or"
" 90-day range."
msgstr ""
"运行时设置键为 "
"`analytics_token_usage_enabled`、`analytics_users_and_requests_enabled`、`analytics_performance_metrics_enabled`"
" 和 `analytics_growth_rate_enabled`。概览的 Hour / Day / Week / Month 控件作用于 "
"Token Usage 和 Users and Requests。Performance Metrics 保留原有时间窗口，Growth Rate"
" 独立提供 30、60 或 90 天的范围。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:556
msgid "On the Settings tab"
msgstr "在 Settings 标签页上"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:558
msgid ""
"The tab opens on **Common**, with the switches and limits changed most "
"often: sign-up, per-user concurrency and the daily quotas among them. The"
" rest is grouped by category, and each category is listed on the sub-tab "
"of its topic: **Access** holds the sign-up settings and the signup "
"allowlist, for instance. **Setup**, near the end, holds the categories "
"usually set once, when the gateway is deployed: its addresses and name, "
"email, network, privacy and integrations. Within any category, the "
"settings usually set once come last, under **Usually set once**. The tab "
"describes each setting and shows where its value comes from. A search, or"
" **Missing only**, looks through every sub-tab at once. Besides every "
"setting the gateway reads itself, it lists:"
msgstr ""
"这个标签页打开时显示 "
"**Common**，里面是最常改动的开关和限额，包括注册、每用户并发上限和每日配额。其余设置项按类别分组，每个类别放在对应主题的子标签页上：比如"
" **Access** 里有注册相关的设置项和注册域名白名单。靠近末尾的 **Setup** "
"放的是通常在部署网关时设置一次的类别：网关的地址和名称、邮件、网络、隐私和集成。在每个类别里，通常只设置一次的设置项排在最后，列在 "
"**Usually set once** 下。这个标签页逐个说明设置项的用途，并标出每个值的来源。搜索或勾选 **Missing only** "
"时，会同时查找所有子标签页。除了网关自己读取的所有设置项，它还列出："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:569
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"every `${VAR}` the active model registry and routing file name, under "
"**Providers**, with the models that use it, and those of the alert rules "
"under **Alerts**;"
msgstr ""
"当前模型注册表和路由配置文件引用的每一个 `${VAR}`，列在 **Providers** 下，并注明用到它的模型；告警规则引用的则列在 "
"**Alerts** 下；"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:572
msgid ""
"numbered extra keys for a provider's key pool, `MINIMAX_API_KEY1` to "
"`MINIMAX_API_KEY20` beside `MINIMAX_API_KEY` for instance, once one is "
"set. Every one that has a value joins the pool: a blank one in the middle"
" does not end the list, and a key entered twice counts once;"
msgstr ""
"provider key 池里带编号的额外 key，比如 `MINIMAX_API_KEY` 旁边的 `MINIMAX_API_KEY1` 到 "
"`MINIMAX_API_KEY20`，只要设置了其中一个就会列出。每个有值的 key 都会加入池子：中间有一个空着并不会让列表就此结束，同一个 "
"key 填了两次也只算一次；"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:576
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"variables added with **Add variable**, for a `${VAR}` reference the "
"gateway cannot see yet, such as one in a registry you are about to switch"
" to."
msgstr "用 **Add variable** 添加的变量，用于网关暂时还看不到的 `${VAR}` 引用，比如你即将切换过去的那份注册表里的引用。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:579
msgid ""
"It leaves out the settings that offer nothing to choose: one with a "
"single accepted value, such as `EMAIL_PROVIDER` while SMTP is the only "
"transport, and the phone settings while no SMS provider is registered, "
"since they do nothing without one. Such a setting still appears while it "
"needs attention — required and empty, stored with a value that cannot "
"apply, or waiting for a restart — and `python -m serving.config.manage "
"list` always shows it."
msgstr ""
"没有可选项的设置不会列出：只接受一个值的设置，比如只有 SMTP 一种发送方式时的 "
"`EMAIL_PROVIDER`；还有没注册短信服务时的手机号相关设置，因为没有短信服务它们不起任何作用。这类设置在需要处理时仍会显示（必填却为空、存储的值无法生效，或者正在等待重启），`python"
" -m serving.config.manage list` 也始终会列出它们。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:586
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Secrets are write-only: the tab shows whether one is set, never its "
"value, and the admin audit log records only that it changed. Besides the "
"settings the gateway knows to be secret, every `${VAR}` a configuration "
"file uses in a credential field — `api_key`, `api_keys`, `token`, an "
"`Authorization` header — is secret, whatever it is called. Any other "
"variable is secret when its name contains `KEY`, `TOKEN`, `SECRET`, "
"`PASSWORD`, `PASS`, `PWD`, `WEBHOOK`, `PRIVATE`, `AUTH`, `CREDENTIAL`, "
"`BEARER`, `CERT`, `DSN` or `SA_JSON`, and a variable added under such a "
"name always is. An administrator can also mark a discovered, numbered or "
"added variable secret with **Mark as secret**. That works one way only: a"
" secret is never shown again, not even after a reset."
msgstr ""
"密钥只能写不能读：标签页只显示它有没有设置，从不显示它的值，管理审计日志也只记录它被改过。除了网关本身就知道是密钥的设置项，配置文件里用在凭据字段（`api_key`、`api_keys`、`token`、`Authorization`"
" 请求头）中的每个 `${VAR}` 也都是密钥，无论它叫什么名字。其他变量的名字里只要含有 "
"`KEY`、`TOKEN`、`SECRET`、`PASSWORD`、`PASS`、`PWD`、`WEBHOOK`、`PRIVATE`、`AUTH`、`CREDENTIAL`、`BEARER`、`CERT`、`DSN`"
" 或 `SA_JSON`，就是密钥；用这样的名字添加的变量一定是密钥。管理员也可以用 **Mark as secret** "
"把从配置文件里发现的变量、带编号的变量或手动添加的变量标为密钥。这个操作只能单向进行：密钥一旦标记，就再也不会显示出来，即使重置之后也一样。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:597
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A save is checked as a whole, against everything it leaves in force, so "
"settings that depend on each other — `TRUST_CLOUDFLARE_HEADERS` needs "
"`TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` — can change together. A save or a **Reset** that "
"would leave another setting unable to apply is refused and names it: "
"turning `TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` off while `TRUST_X_REAL_IP` is on, for "
"example, or clearing the Cloudflare networks while "
"`TRUST_CLOUDFLARE_HEADERS` is on. Change both in one save. A **Reset** is"
" also refused when the environment value it would fall back to is not "
"valid. A setting that was already invalid never blocks an unrelated "
"change. The names that stay in the environment, such as `DB_PASSWORD` or "
"`MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`, cannot be set here. Behind the tab are `GET` and "
"`PATCH /admin/config` and `DELETE /admin/config/{key}`. A save or a "
"**Reset** of a security-relevant setting, one a restore lists for "
"confirmation (see [Backup and restore](#backup-and-restore)) and each "
"entry marks with `security_relevant`, asks for your password, which the "
"API takes as `password` (in the JSON body of a `DELETE`). The admin token "
"gives no password, so it changes only the other settings; `python -m "
"serving.config.manage` still changes any of them on the host."
msgstr ""
"一次保存会作为整体校验，并按保存后实际生效的全部配置来判断，所以相互依赖的设置项（比如 `TRUST_CLOUDFLARE_HEADERS` 需要"
" `TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS`）可以一起修改。如果一次保存或 **Reset** "
"会让另一个设置项无法生效，它会被拒绝，并指出是哪一项：例如在 `TRUST_X_REAL_IP` 开着时关掉 "
"`TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS`，或者在 `TRUST_CLOUDFLARE_HEADERS` 开着时清空 Cloudflare "
"网段。把两项放在同一次保存里修改即可。如果 **Reset** 后要回落到的环境变量值本身不合法，Reset "
"也会被拒绝。原本就无效的设置项不会挡住无关的修改。留在环境变量里的名字，比如 `DB_PASSWORD` 或 "
"`MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`，不能在这里设置。这个标签页背后是 `GET` 和 `PATCH /admin/config`，以及 "
"`DELETE /admin/config/{key}`。保存或 **Reset** 涉及安全的设置项时（即恢复备份时会列出来要求确认的那些，参见"
"[备份与恢复](#backup-and-restore)，每个条目用 `security_relevant` 标明）需要输入你的密码，API 通过 "
"`password` 接收它（`DELETE` 请求放在 JSON 请求体里）。admin token 无法提供密码，所以只能修改其他设置项；在主机上，"
"`python -m serving.config.manage` 仍然可以修改任何设置项。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:610
msgid "Backup and restore"
msgstr "备份与恢复"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:612
msgid ""
"**Backup** (`GET /admin/config/backup`) downloads every setting an "
"administrator can change as one JSON file: the stored settings, the "
"runtime and model settings, custom providers and their keys, routes and "
"their overrides, the batch caps and the signup allowlist. It names each "
"secret without its value: a stored setting has `value: null` and "
"`is_set`, and a provider key keeps its id, provider and label. **Backup "
"with secrets** (`POST /admin/config/backup` with `include_secrets: true`)"
" puts the values in, in plain text, once the signed-in administrator "
"gives the account's password again. The admin token cannot ask for them, "
"and an account without a password, made by phone, sets one first. Store "
"that file as you would the secrets themselves."
msgstr ""
"**Backup**（`GET /admin/config/backup`）把管理员能修改的全部设置下载为一个 JSON "
"文件：存储的设置、运行时与模型设置、自定义 provider 及其 "
"key、路由及其覆盖、批处理上限和注册白名单。每个密钥只写名字、不写值：存储的设置是 `value: null` 加 "
"`is_set`，provider key 保留它的 id、provider 和标签。**Backup with secrets**（`POST "
"/admin/config/backup`，带 `include_secrets: "
"true`）会把这些值以明文写进文件，前提是已登录的管理员再输入一次账号密码。admin token "
"不能请求这些值；没有密码的账号（用手机注册的）要先设置一个。保管这个文件要像保管密钥本身一样小心。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:623
msgid ""
"**Restore** (`POST /admin/config/restore`) replaces all of it in one database transaction, so a failure anywhere leaves the deployment as it was. A secret the file withholds keeps the value this deployment has; one the deployment has no value for stays unset, and the response names it under `secrets_not_restored`. A backup file is not signed, so a restore that changes anything security-relevant needs a confirmation and the password: any secret, the Security, Network, Phone authentication and Privacy settings, every `*_URL` setting and every variable a configuration file references, mail delivery, who is told about new accounts and the support address, the identity issuer, keys and redirects, user authentication, the sign-up switches and allowlist, full request logging, who may submit batches and private batch webhook targets, whether alerts are sent and which are snoozed or muted, the request body limit, the tier a model or a provider key is reserved for, and where a custom provider or a route sends requests and keys, and as which deployment type. An alert snooze in the file must end within seven days. The console lists those changes before it restores, from `POST /admin/config/restore/preview`; a script sends that list back as `confirm_security_changes`, with `password`, and a restore whose changes differ from the confirmed list is refused with 409. The admin token can restore only a file that changes none of them."
msgstr ""
"**Restore**（`POST /admin/config/restore`）在一个数据库事务里替换上述全部内容，所以任何一处出错，部署都保持原样。文件里没有给出值的密钥保留本部署现有的值；本部署也没有值的，则保持未设置，并在响应的 `secrets_not_restored` 中列出。备份文件没有签名，所以凡是涉及安全的改动都需要确认并输入密码：任何密钥、Security、Network、Phone authentication 和 Privacy 分类的设置、所有 `*_URL` 设置和配置文件引用的每个变量、邮件投递、新账号通知发给谁以及支持邮箱地址、身份签发方及其密钥和重定向地址、用户认证、注册开关和白名单、完整请求日志、谁可以提交批处理以及批处理 webhook 的内网目标、是否发送告警以及哪些告警被暂停或静音、请求体大小上限、模型或 provider key 保留给哪个等级，以及自定义 provider 或路由把请求和 key 发往何处、按哪种部署类型发送。文件里的告警暂停必须在七天内结束。控制台在恢复之前会列出这些改动，来源是 `POST /admin/config/restore/preview`；脚本则要把这份列表作为 `confirm_security_changes` 连同 `password` 一起发回，改动与确认的列表不一致的恢复会被以 409 拒绝。admin token 只能恢复不涉及这些改动的文件。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:639
msgid "When a change applies"
msgstr "改动何时生效"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:641
msgid ""
"Most settings apply as soon as they are saved: at once in the backend "
"process that served the save, and within ten seconds in every other one. "
"A setting marked **Restart required** is read only at startup, and the "
"process keeps the value it started with until it restarts. Provider "
"credentials and every variable the registry names are among them, as are "
"the circuit-breaker and outbound-concurrency tuning, `ALERTS_ENABLED` and"
" `DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT`. The alert channels and the failed-request alert"
" thresholds are too, until an operator activates their [live group"
"](#settings-that-apply-without-a-restart)."
msgstr ""
"大多数设置项一保存就生效：处理这次保存的后端进程立即生效，其他后端进程在十秒内生效。标着 **Restart required** "
"的设置项只在启动时读取，进程会一直用启动时的值，直到重启。provider "
"凭据和注册表引用的每个变量都属于这一类，熔断器和出站并发的调优、`ALERTS_ENABLED` 以及 "
"`DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` 也是。告警渠道和失败请求告警阈值在操作者激活它们的[实时配置组](#settings-that-"
"apply-without-a-restart)之前也属于这一类。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:650
msgid ""
"While such a change is waiting, the tab shows a **Restart pending** "
"notice with a **Restart backend** button. The button (`POST "
"/admin/system/restart`) makes the backend exit so that its supervisor "
"starts it again: Docker, through the bundled Compose file's `restart: "
"unless-stopped`, or systemd, through the bundled units' `Restart=on-"
"failure`. Nothing inside the process can see that policy, so the "
"deployment declares it: the bundled Compose file and units set "
"`SUPERVISOR_RESTARTS_BACKEND=1` next to it, and a deployment that starts "
"the backend some other way sets it only if its supervisor restarts the "
"process when it exits. Without it, and whenever several worker processes "
"serve the backend (`WEB_CONCURRENCY` or `UVICORN_WORKERS` above 1, or "
"`uvicorn --workers`, where the button would restart only one of them), "
"the tab shows a command to run yourself instead, such as `docker restart "
"hybridinference-backend`. A restart cuts off requests in flight, streams "
"included. The console knows the restart is over once `/health` names a "
"different process in its `instance` field, however quickly the backend "
"came back."
msgstr ""
"有这类改动在等待时，标签页会显示 **Restart pending** 提示和一个 **Restart backend** "
"按钮。这个按钮（`POST /admin/system/restart`）会让后端退出，由它的守护进程重新拉起：Docker 靠仓库自带 "
"Compose 文件里的 `restart: unless-stopped`，systemd 靠自带 unit 里的 `Restart=on-"
"failure`。进程内部看不到这项重启策略，所以要由部署来声明：自带的 Compose 文件和 unit 在重启策略旁边设置了 "
"`SUPERVISOR_RESTARTS_BACKEND=1`；用其他方式启动后端的部署，只有当它的守护进程会在进程退出后把它重新拉起时，才应设置这个变量。没有设置它时，以及后端由多个"
" worker 进程提供服务时（`WEB_CONCURRENCY` 或 `UVICORN_WORKERS` 大于 1，或者用了 `uvicorn "
"--workers`，这时按钮只能重启其中一个进程），标签页会改为给出一条让你自己运行的命令，比如 `docker restart "
"hybridinference-backend`。重启会切断正在处理的请求，流式请求也不例外。控制台以 `/health` 的 "
"`instance` 字段换成另一个进程作为重启完成的标志，所以后端回来得再快也不会被漏掉。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:667
msgid "Settings that apply without a restart"
msgstr "无需重启即可生效的设置项"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:669
msgid ""
"A live group is a set of settings the backend applies together, without a"
" restart, once an operator has activated it. The first one, "
"`alerts.runtime`, holds the alert channel and the failed-request alert:"
msgstr "实时配置组是后端一起应用、无需重启的一组设置项，前提是操作者已经激活它。第一个组 `alerts.runtime` 包含告警渠道和失败请求告警："

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid "What they choose"
msgstr "决定什么"

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid ""
"`SLACK_ALERTS_WEBHOOK_URL`, `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`, "
"`WECOM_ALERTS_WEBHOOK_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid "The one channel alerts go to"
msgstr "告警发往的唯一渠道"

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid ""
"`FAILED_REQUEST_ALERT_THRESHOLD`, `FAILED_REQUEST_ALERT_WINDOW_MINUTES`, "
"`FAILED_REQUEST_ALERT_COOLDOWN_MINUTES`, `FAILED_REQUEST_ALERT_RATE`, "
"`FAILED_REQUEST_ALERT_RATE_MIN_COUNT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid "When the failed-request alert pages"
msgstr "失败请求告警何时发出"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:678
msgid ""
"Once the group is active, a save reaches every backend process within "
"about ten seconds. Each process checks the whole group first: a pair of "
"channels that conflict, or a value out of range, keeps the values it "
"already uses and reports the group as invalid, while the saved values "
"stay for you to correct. To move from Slack to WeCom, clear the Slack "
"webhooks and fill in the WeCom one in the same save. Clearing every "
"webhook pauses alert delivery and the failed-request alert on purpose; it"
" is not a failure. The failed-request alert runs while "
"`SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL` or `WECOM_ALERTS_WEBHOOK_URL` is set, as before; "
"`SLACK_ALERTS_WEBHOOK_URL` alone does not start it."
msgstr ""
"组激活后，一次保存会在约十秒内到达每个后端进程。每个进程先检查整个组：渠道互相冲突或数值越界时，进程继续使用当前的值并把该组报告为无效，已保存的值保留下来供你修正。要从"
" Slack 换成企业微信，请在同一次保存中清空 Slack webhook 并填入企业微信 webhook。清空所有 webhook "
"会有意暂停告警投递和失败请求告警，这不是故障。和以前一样，设置了 `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL` 或 "
"`WECOM_ALERTS_WEBHOOK_URL` 时失败请求告警才运行；只设置 `SLACK_ALERTS_WEBHOOK_URL` "
"不会启动它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:688
msgid ""
"The Alerts category shows where the saved configuration stands. **Applied"
" in each backend process** names the saved version — for example "
"`app_config / epoch 3f1c… / revision 42` — and, for every process that "
"has registered, whether it has applied that revision, is still applying "
"it, failed or has not reported. A process whose heartbeat stopped more "
"than a minute ago counts as unknown, never as applied. A backend running "
"an older build does not register at all, so the panel cannot prove that "
"every process is covered: compare its list with your deployment's own "
"list of processes. **Applied** means the process uses the saved channel "
"and thresholds; it says nothing about whether a message reached the "
"channel, which **Send test** checks. **Send test** uses the saved webhook"
" (or the address you typed), not necessarily the one a process is using."
msgstr ""
"Alerts 分类显示已保存的配置处于什么状态。**Applied in each backend process** 给出已保存的版本，例如 "
"`app_config / epoch 3f1c… / revision "
"42`，并对每个已登记的进程说明它是已应用该版本、仍在应用、失败，还是尚未汇报。心跳停止超过一分钟的进程算作未知，绝不算作已应用。运行旧版本的后端根本不会登记，因此面板无法证明所有进程都已覆盖：请把它的列表和部署自己的进程列表对照。**Applied**"
" 表示进程正在使用已保存的渠道和阈值，并不说明消息是否送达了渠道，送达请用 **Send test** 检查。**Send test** "
"使用已保存的 webhook（或你输入的地址），不一定是某个进程正在使用的那个。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:701
msgid ""
"After a channel change, alerts already under way finish on the old "
"channel, and the recovery message of an incident opened earlier goes to "
"the new one. The failed-request alert keeps its cooldown and its open "
"incident across the change. It still checks once a minute, so a new "
"threshold takes effect at the next check after the change has applied."
msgstr "换渠道之后，已经在发送的告警仍在旧渠道完成，此前打开的事故的恢复消息会发到新渠道。失败请求告警在切换前后保留冷却时间和未关闭的事故。它仍然每分钟检查一次，所以新阈值在改动应用之后的下一次检查才生效。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:707
msgid ""
"The console saves conditionally: if someone else saved the configuration "
"after you started editing a category, your save is refused, nothing is "
"stored, and the tab reloads the latest values and keeps your unsaved "
"changes for you to review and save again. A reload, or a save in another "
"category, never moves unsaved changes onto values you have not seen."
msgstr "控制台按条件保存：如果在你开始编辑某个分类之后有人保存了配置，你的保存会被拒绝，不写入任何内容，页面会重新加载最新值，并保留你未保存的改动，供你核对后再次保存。重新加载或在其他分类中保存，都不会把未保存的改动挪到你没有看过的值之上。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:713
msgid ""
"`ALERTS_ENABLED`, the alert rules file and the alert engine still apply "
"only after a restart. Other settings join live groups later, one group at"
" a time."
msgstr "`ALERTS_ENABLED`、告警规则文件和告警引擎仍然只在重启后生效。其他设置项以后会逐组加入实时配置组。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:716
msgid "Activating a live group"
msgstr "激活实时配置组"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:718
msgid ""
"A group stays inactive until an operator activates it, and a backend "
"upgrade never activates one by itself. Until then its settings behave as "
"**Restart required**. Activate it once every backend process runs a build"
" that supports it:"
msgstr ""
"组在操作者激活之前一直不生效，后端升级也不会自动激活它。在此之前，它的设置项按 **Restart required** "
"的方式工作。等每个后端进程都运行支持它的版本之后再激活："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:723
msgid ""
"Deploy the build everywhere and check that each process registered: "
"`python -m serving.config.manage live status`."
msgstr "把该版本部署到所有地方，并检查每个进程都已登记：`python -m serving.config.manage live status`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:725
msgid ""
"Preview what activation applies. It shows each setting's saved value (a "
"secret only as set or not set) and the processes whose value in use "
"differs — values saved while a restart was pending apply as soon as you "
"activate, which can change where alerts go: `python -m "
"serving.config.manage live preview alerts.runtime`."
msgstr ""
"预览激活会应用什么。它显示每个设置项已保存的值（秘密值只显示是否已设置），以及正在使用的值与之不同的进程——等待重启时保存的值会在激活时立刻生效，可能改变告警发往的地方：`python"
" -m serving.config.manage live preview alerts.runtime`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:730
msgid ""
"Activate with the version the preview printed, and the number of backend "
"processes your deployment runs: `python -m serving.config.manage live "
"activate alerts.runtime --expect <epoch>:<revision> --expect-instances "
"<N>`. It refuses when the configuration changed after the preview, when a"
" running process does not support the group, or when the count differs."
msgstr ""
"用预览打印的版本和部署运行的后端进程数激活：`python -m serving.config.manage live activate "
"alerts.runtime --expect <epoch>:<revision> --expect-instances "
"<N>`。如果预览之后配置有变化、有正在运行的进程不支持该组，或者进程数不符，命令会拒绝激活。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:735
msgid ""
"Check `live status`, or the Alerts category, until every process has "
"applied the latest revision."
msgstr "查看 `live status` 或 Alerts 分类，直到每个进程都应用了最新版本。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:738
msgid ""
"If a process cannot apply the group when it is activated — a saved value "
"is invalid, say — the group stays active and the process keeps the values"
" it was using. Correct the setting and save it again: it applies without "
"a restart."
msgstr "如果激活时某个进程无法应用该组（例如某个已保存的值无效），该组仍保持激活，该进程继续使用原来的值。修正该设置并再次保存即可，无需重启就会生效。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:742
msgid ""
"`live deactivate alerts.runtime --expect <epoch>:<revision>` turns the "
"group off. A running process then keeps the values it last applied until "
"it restarts, instead of returning to the ones it started with, and a "
"process that starts afterwards uses the saved values. Until every process"
" has restarted the two can differ, and the status shows it. Going back to"
" a build that does not know the group is a deployment, not a "
"configuration change."
msgstr ""
"`live deactivate alerts.runtime --expect <epoch>:<revision>` "
"会关闭该组。之后正在运行的进程会一直保留它最后应用的值，直到重启，而不会回到启动时的值；之后启动的进程使用已保存的值。在每个进程都重启之前，两者可能不同，状态会显示出来。退回到不认识该组的版本属于部署，不是配置改动。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:749
msgid ""
"A configuration backup does not include this status. Restoring a backup "
"applies its `app_config` rows to live groups like any other save, and "
"writes the other tables in the same transaction, so a failure anywhere "
"restores none of them. After restoring a whole database, run `python -m "
"serving.config.manage live reset-epoch --expect <epoch>:<revision>`: it "
"starts a new version history and makes every process register again."
msgstr ""
"配置备份不包含这些状态。恢复备份时，备份中的 `app_config` "
"行会像任何一次保存一样应用到实时配置组，其他表也在同一个事务里写入，所以任何一处出错，就什么都不会恢复。恢复整个数据库之后，运行 `python "
"-m serving.config.manage live reset-epoch --expect "
"<epoch>:<revision>`：它会开始新的版本历史，并让每个进程重新登记。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:756
msgid "Without the console"
msgstr "不通过控制台"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:758
msgid ""
"A setting can break the console that edits it — a value that stops sign-"
"in from working, say. `python -m serving.config.manage` changes stored "
"settings from the command line instead, with the console's own "
"validation:"
msgstr ""
"某个设置项可能把用来编辑它的控制台本身弄坏——比如一个让登录失效的值。这时可以用 `python -m "
"serving.config.manage` 在命令行里修改已存储的设置项，校验规则和控制台完全一样："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:767
msgid ""
"`list` shows every setting, `get KEY` one of them, `set KEY VALUE` stores"
" a value — add `--secret` to mark a discovered, numbered or added "
"variable secret, as **Mark as secret** does — and `reset KEY` resets it "
"as the tab's **Reset** does, so that the environment or the default "
"applies again. It never prints a secret's value. A running backend picks "
"a change up within about ten seconds, or at its next restart for a "
"setting marked **Restart required**."
msgstr ""
"`list` 列出所有设置项，`get KEY` 查看其中一项，`set KEY VALUE` 存入一个值（加上 `--secret` "
"会把从配置文件里发现的变量、带编号的变量或手动添加的变量标为密钥，和 **Mark as secret** 的作用一样），`reset KEY` "
"则像标签页上的 **Reset** 一样重置它，让环境变量或默认值重新生效。它从不打印密钥的值。正在运行的后端会在大约十秒内读到改动；标着 "
"**Restart required** 的设置项则要等下次重启。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:774
msgid ""
"The tool talks to the database directly with the `DB_*` connection "
"settings alone, so it needs no sign-in and still runs when another "
"setting in the environment is invalid. Like the backend, it first reads "
"`.env` from the directory it runs in, without replacing a variable "
"already set, so a value kept only there is the one it shows and the one a"
" reset falls back to. When the backend container is not running, run it "
"in the repository root of a source checkout instead (`uv run python -m "
"serving.config.manage ...`), where `.env` reaches Postgres on "
"`127.0.0.1:5432`. The command that resets an administrator's password "
"works the same way; see [The first admin account](deployment.md#the-"
"first-admin-account)."
msgstr ""
"这个工具只用 `DB_*` 连接设置直接访问数据库，所以不需要登录，环境变量里别的设置项无效时也照样能运行。和后端一样，它会先读取所在目录下的 "
"`.env`，但不会替换已经设置的变量，所以只写在那里的值，就是它显示的值，也是重置后回落到的值。后端容器没在运行时，改在源码 checkout "
"的仓库根目录下运行它（`uv run python -m serving.config.manage ...`），那里的 `.env` 可以通过 "
"`127.0.0.1:5432` 连上 Postgres。重置管理员密码的命令也是同样的用法，见[第一个管理员账号](deployment.md"
"#the-first-admin-account)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:785
msgid "Missing settings"
msgstr "缺失的设置项"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:787
msgid ""
"Some settings are required: the two generated secrets, every variable a "
"model route needs to load (unless the route is `optional: true`), and "
"`SMTP_USER` and `SMTP_PASSWORD` while public signup requires email "
"verification. When one of them has no value, the console shows a banner "
"to signed-in users. Administrators get a link to the Settings tab, where "
"**Missing only** lists what to fill in; everyone else is told that some "
"features may not work and to contact the administrator. A model whose "
"credential is missing is not loaded, and a request for it is answered "
"with a `404`. When an administrator sends it with their own API key, the "
"`404` says the deployment's configuration is incomplete; anyone else gets"
" the same \"not found\" as for a model the deployment does not define, so"
" the difference reveals nothing beyond what they may use."
msgstr ""
"有些设置项是必填的：那两个自动生成的密钥、模型路由加载时需要的每个变量（路由标了 `optional: true` "
"的除外），以及公开注册要求邮箱验证时的 `SMTP_USER` 和 "
"`SMTP_PASSWORD`。其中任何一个没有值时，控制台会给已登录的用户显示一条横幅。管理员看到的是指向 Settings "
"标签页的链接，在那里勾选 **Missing only** "
"就能列出要填的项；其他人看到的则是部分功能可能无法使用、请联系管理员。缺少凭据的模型不会被加载，对它的请求会得到一个 `404`。管理员用自己的 "
"API key 发起请求时，这个 `404` 会说明部署的配置不完整；其他人得到的则和请求一个部署里根本没有定义的模型时一样，都是“not "
"found”，所以从这个差别里看不出任何超出其可用范围的信息。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:800
msgid ""
"A deployment that leaves a model's credential unset on purpose — a route "
"it does not use yet, or a canary it enables elsewhere — should mark that "
"route `optional: true` in the model registry. The route is then skipped "
"quietly, and its variable is not reported as missing."
msgstr ""
"如果部署有意不设置某个模型的凭据——比如一条暂时不用的路由，或者在别处才启用的 canary——就应该在模型注册表里给那条路由标上 "
"`optional: true`。这样这条路由会被悄悄跳过，它的变量也不会被报告为缺失。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:806
msgid ""
"Settings are stored in plaintext. Anyone who can read the database — a "
"`pg_dump`, a backup, a `psql` or pgAdmin session — can read every "
"provider key, decrypt users' stored API keys and sign administrator "
"tokens. Protect database access and backups as you would the credentials "
"themselves."
msgstr ""
"设置项以明文存储。任何能读到数据库的人——通过 `pg_dump`、备份，或者 `psql`、pgAdmin 会话——都能读到每一个 "
"provider key，解密用户存下的 API key，并签发管理员 token。要像保护这些凭据本身那样，保护数据库的访问权限和备份。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:812
msgid "Environment variables"
msgstr "环境变量"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:814
msgid ""
"The environment keeps what the backend needs before it can reach its "
"database and what describes the containers rather than the application:"
msgstr "环境变量里留下的，是后端连上数据库之前就需要的东西，以及描述容器而不是应用本身的东西："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:817
msgid ""
"the database connection: `DB_HOST`, `DB_PORT`, `DB_NAME`, `DB_USER`, "
"`DB_PASSWORD`, `DB_ENABLED`;"
msgstr "数据库连接：`DB_HOST`、`DB_PORT`、`DB_NAME`、`DB_USER`、`DB_PASSWORD`、`DB_ENABLED`；"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:819
msgid ""
"the configuration files: `MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`, `ROUTING_CONFIG_PATH`, "
"`ALERTS_CONFIG_PATH`, `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH`, "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE`;"
msgstr "配置文件：`MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`、`ROUTING_CONFIG_PATH`、`ALERTS_CONFIG_PATH`、`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH`、`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE`；"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:822
msgid ""
"the backend process: `LOG_FILE`, `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS`, "
"`GEOIP_COUNTRY_DB`, `GEOIP_COUNTRY_PROVIDER`, `WEB_CONCURRENCY`, "
"`SUPERVISOR_RESTARTS_BACKEND`, and `REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME`, which the"
" console reads too;"
msgstr ""
"后端进程：`LOG_FILE`、`BACKEND_EXTENSIONS`、`GEOIP_COUNTRY_DB`、`GEOIP_COUNTRY_PROVIDER`、`WEB_CONCURRENCY`、`SUPERVISOR_RESTARTS_BACKEND`，以及控制台也会读取的"
" `REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME`；"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:825
msgid ""
"Compose and the console: host ports and bind addresses, the console's "
"build values and its runtime ones such as `AGENT_WEB_INTERNAL_URL`."
msgstr "Compose 和控制台：宿主机端口和绑定地址，控制台的构建期取值，以及 `AGENT_WEB_INTERNAL_URL` 这类运行期取值。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:828
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The gateway reads a `.env` file from its working directory and the "
"process environment; the process environment wins. `.env.example` in the "
"repository root is the annotated list — copy it to `.env` and edit. "
"[Installation](installation.md#environment-variables) lists the settings "
"you are most likely to set. A value in the environment for any other "
"setting is imported into the database at startup, as described above. "
"Never write a secret into the model registry or the manifest: reference "
"it there as `${VAR}`."
msgstr ""
"网关会读取工作目录下的 `.env` 文件和进程环境变量；两者冲突时以进程环境变量为准。仓库根目录下的 `.env.example` "
"是带注释的变量清单——把它复制成 `.env` 再改。[安装](installation.md#environment-"
"variables)列出了你最可能要设置的设置项。其他设置项如果在环境变量里有值，会按上文所述在启动时导入数据库。永远不要把密钥写进模型注册表或 "
"manifest：在那里用 `${VAR}` 引用它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:837
msgid "Running with your configuration"
msgstr "用你自己的配置运行"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:843
msgid "Then check what actually loaded:"
msgstr "然后检查实际加载了什么："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:850
msgid ""
"The startup log says what was loaded. `Registered N routes from <path>` "
"names the registry file that was used; `[distribution dark mode] ...` "
"lines show what a manifest would change once activated; `Skipping model "
"'<id>' ... after env expansion` names each model whose credentials were "
"unset."
msgstr ""
"启动日志会告诉你加载了什么。`Registered N routes from <path>` "
"指出实际使用的是哪个注册表文件；`[distribution dark mode] ...` 这几行显示 manifest "
"启用后会改变什么；`Skipping model '<id>' ... after env expansion` 逐个列出凭据没有设置的模型。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:855
msgid ""
"`GET /routing` requires no credentials and returns, for every published "
"route, its provider label and its weight. Each route's upstream "
"`base_url`, and the routing file's probe results, which are keyed by "
"endpoint URL, are shown only to a caller that sends an administrator's "
"JWT or `ADMIN_TOKEN` in the `Authorization: Bearer ...` header; any other"
" caller, or a credential that does not check out, gets the anonymous "
"answer with the same status code. `GET /admin/routing` requires those "
"credentials and additionally reports unpublished routes. Treat their "
"output as sensitive: it is your upstream topology, including any host and"
" port embedded in a base URL."
msgstr ""
"`GET /routing` 不需要任何凭据，会返回每条已发布路由的 provider 标签和权重。每条路由的上游 "
"`base_url`，以及以端点 URL 为键的路由配置文件探测结果，只展示给在 `Authorization: Bearer ...` "
"头里带上管理员 JWT 或 `ADMIN_TOKEN` 的调用方；其他调用方，或者凭据校验不通过的调用方，得到的是匿名视图，状态码不变。`GET "
"/admin/routing` 必须带这些凭据，并且还会返回未发布的路由。它们的输出要当作敏感信息：那是你的上游拓扑，包括 base URL "
"里的主机和端口。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:865
msgid "Optional phone authentication"
msgstr "可选手机号认证"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:867
msgid ""
"Phone signup, login and binding are disabled by default. Install a "
"distribution-owned SMS provider, configure its delivery settings, then "
"enable `SMS_AUTH_ENABLED` and select that registered provider through "
"`SMS_PROVIDER` in **Admin > Configuration**, where the phone settings "
"appear once a provider is registered. The gateway advertises "
"`features.phone_auth` through `/site-config`; the shared forms show the "
"phone option only when it is available. Existing email and first-run "
"administrator logins continue to work."
msgstr ""
"手机号注册、登录和绑定默认关闭。安装发行版拥有的短信服务并完成发送配置后，在 **Admin > Configuration** 中启用 "
"`SMS_AUTH_ENABLED`，再通过 `SMS_PROVIDER` "
"选择已注册的服务；注册了短信服务之后，手机号相关设置才会出现在该页面。网关通过 `/site-config` 发布 "
"`features.phone_auth`；共享表单仅在该功能可用时显示手机号选项。原有邮箱登录和首次启动管理员登录保持可用。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:869
msgid ""
"Account identifiers use international format, such as `+12025550123`. "
"`SMS_DEFAULT_COUNTRY_CODE` optionally supplies a calling code for local "
"input; leave it empty to require international input. "
"`SMS_ALLOWED_PREFIXES` optionally restricts destinations using comma-"
"separated prefixes. The distribution chooses a number policy supported by"
" its delivery provider; account storage and verification-code policy "
"remain shared."
msgstr ""
"账号标识使用国际格式，例如 `+12025550123`。`SMS_DEFAULT_COUNTRY_CODE` "
"可为本地号码补充区号；留空时必须输入国际格式。`SMS_ALLOWED_PREFIXES` "
"可通过逗号分隔的前缀限制目的地。发行版选择发送服务支持的号码策略；账号存储和验证码策略仍由共享核心负责。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:871
msgid ""
"Codes expire after 300 seconds by default, allow at most five guesses, "
"and can be consumed once. PostgreSQL serializes send and verification "
"quotas across workers; the `SMS_OTP_*` settings control their bounds. "
"Turnstile and trusted-proxy client IP handling remain shared with signup."
" Phone registration follows public-signup and approval policy, never "
"automatically merges with an email account, and creates no password. Like"
" email signup, it is refused with `503` while first-run setup is pending."
" Binding requires an authenticated session and a separate code for that "
"account."
msgstr ""
"验证码默认 300 秒过期，最多允许猜测五次，且只能使用一次。PostgreSQL "
"在多个工作进程间串行执行发送和验证配额检查；`SMS_OTP_*` 设置控制相关限制。Turnstile 与可信代理客户端 IP "
"处理继续复用注册流程。手机号注册遵循开放注册和审核策略，不会自动合并邮箱账号，也不会创建密码。和邮箱注册一样，首次运行设置完成之前，手机号注册会被拒绝并返回"
" `503`。绑定需要已认证会话及专属于该账号的验证码。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:873
msgid ""
"Startup adds phone identity columns and durable code tables and makes "
"password hashes nullable. When a long-running `pg_dump` holds the users "
"table, the columns land later, from the background, and phone sign-in "
"answers `503` until they do; see [Database](database.md#how-the-schema-"
"is-created). Upgrade every gateway worker before enabling phone signup. "
"Back up the database first; once phone-only accounts exist, an older "
"binary that assumes every account has a password is not a supported "
"rollback. Disabling SMS hides phone login but does not remove accounts, "
"so arrange another verified sign-in method before disabling it for phone-"
"only users. Site UI v1 message overrides remain optional; distributions "
"can translate the added phone message slots without owning authentication"
" logic."
msgstr ""
"启动时会添加手机号身份字段和持久验证码表，并允许密码哈希为空。如果长时间运行的 `pg_dump` 占着 users "
"表，这些字段会稍后在后台加上，在此之前手机号登录会返回 `503`；见[数据库](database.md#how-the-schema-is-"
"created)。开启手机号注册前应先升级全部网关工作进程，并备份数据库。一旦存在仅使用手机号的账号，就不支持回滚到假设每个账号都有密码的旧程序。关闭短信会隐藏手机号登录，但不会删除账号，因此为仅使用手机号的用户关闭该功能前，应先安排其他已验证的登录方式。Site"
" UI v1 文案覆盖仍为可选；发行版可翻译新增手机号文案槽位，无需自行维护认证逻辑。"

